{"articleNo":"698","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=698&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"등록금 분할납부 2차분 납부 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.03.13","hit":"14086","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>* 등록금 분할납부 2차분 납부 안내 *</strong></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\">1. 납부기간 : </font><font color=\"#dc143c\"><strong><u>2009.03.18(수)~03.20(금)</u> </strong></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#dc143c\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#000000\">혹은(또는) 4.15(수)~4.17(금)</font></strong></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\">2. 납부장소 : </font><font color=\"#dc143c\"><strong>농협중앙회 금오공대지점(글로벌관 128호)</strong></font></p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>(타지점에서 납부 불가)</u></font></strong></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\">3. 고지서 발급</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;분할납부 신청시 발급받은 고지서로 납부 가능</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; - 분실시 경리팀에서 발급 가능(글로벌관 533호)</font></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
